1
00:00:01,920 --> 00:00:02,960
The End

2
00:00:14,980 --> 00:00:16,240
Stop right there!

3
00:00:16,440 --> 00:00:17,897
Unless you want to die, move!

4
00:00:17,980 --> 00:00:20,257
All three of you, get away from the water!

5
00:00:20,340 --> 00:00:22,516
Don't go trying to do anything funny.

6
00:00:22,620 --> 00:00:25,260
The enemy here is one of you!

7
00:00:28,720 --> 00:00:29,550
You!

8
00:00:29,633 --> 00:00:30,463
Enemy.

9
00:00:30,546 --> 00:00:31,376
Don't act like you're innocent.

10
00:00:31,459 --> 00:00:35,097
I'm talking about the one that killed
that guard and tried to drown us.

11
00:00:35,180 --> 00:00:36,937
Now it's our job to figure
out which one of you

12
00:00:37,020 --> 00:00:39,785
bitches is the imposter
or we're all gonna die.

13
00:00:40,320 --> 00:00:42,220
Are you serious, Psycho?

14
00:00:42,340 --> 00:00:44,297
I know you heard me, you dumb bitch.

15
00:00:44,380 --> 00:00:45,909
And if I recall correctly?

16
00:00:46,080 --> 00:00:50,433
Didn't the Chaka who blew up say
something about not knowing who you were?

17
00:00:50,560 --> 00:00:52,325
You two, can you back that up?

18
00:00:52,420 --> 00:00:55,949
Do you remember seeing her when
we formed this search party?

19
