water all over the floor.

215
00:12:59,920 --> 00:13:00,860
Wrong move.

216
00:13:10,260 --> 00:13:12,197
While you were pondering
how to kill me you

217
00:13:12,280 --> 00:13:14,137
didn't hear me start the
tractor with my threat.

218
00:13:14,220 --> 00:13:16,657
I guess the sound of the
water masked the noise

219
00:13:16,740 --> 00:13:19,837
so since you were
preoccupied i made my move.

220
00:13:19,920 --> 00:13:23,997
The tractor has left the storehouse and
the discs you vowed to protect are gone.

221
00:13:24,080 --> 00:13:25,037
You...

222
00:13:25,120 --> 00:13:26,680
you asshole!

223
00:13:33,500 --> 00:13:35,206
Remember what you have there!

224
00:13:35,320 --> 00:13:37,320
Those discs are not yours to take!

225
00:13:37,500 --> 00:13:38,676
Please stay with me!

226
00:13:45,940 --> 00:13:49,617
Soil and Fields is a lot softer
than the area near the wetlands.

227
00:13:49,700 --> 00:13:52,157
The more you run, the more water you lose.

228
00:13:52,240 --> 00:13:55,358
And where you're going,
there ain't no water, either!

229
00:13:58,840 --> 00:14:00,300
You vile care!

230
00:14:00,580 --> 00:14:02,639
I'll never let you touch the disks!

231
00:14:04,960 --> 00:14:07,180
Seems Jolene won this battle of wits.

232
00:14:07,760 --> 00:14:10,348
Your precious disks no
longer belong to you.

233
00:14:13,220 --> 00:14:14,540
This is it, asshole!

234
00:14:14,880 --> 00:14:18,821
Dry up and spend the rest of your
days in this field as fertilizer!

235
00:14:23,200 --> 00:14:24,030
Jolene?

236
00:14:37,620 --> 00:14:39,973
Jolene, what do you think you're doing?!

237
00:14:40,680 --> 00:14:41,697
I'm giving it water.

238
00:14:41,780 --> 00:14:44,600
Basically, I'm saving it. Huh?

239
00:14:45,000 --> 00:14:46,720
This being called FF.

240
00:14:47,180 --> 00:14:51,651
It was never truly protecting the disks
because it's what Pale Snake wanted.

241
00:14:52,140 --> 00:14:53,728
I can see that clearly now.

242
00:14:53,980 --> 00:14:57,737
Even though it knew its body would slowly
diminish if it ran into the fields,

243
00:14:57,820 --> 00:14:59,717
it continued chasing the tractor.

244
00:14:59,800 --> 00:15:04,271
I think it was protecting the Discs as
a way of protecting its own identity.

245
00:15:04,860 --> 00:15:08,037
Because of the power and intellect
given to it by the Discs,

246
00:15:08,120 --> 00:15:10,657
it put its life on the line
out of gratitude for being

247
00:15:10,740 --> 00:15:13,975
able to exist in this world
as an intelligent lifeform.

248
00:15:14,740 --> 00:15:18,517
Essentially, it doesn't give a damn
about Pale Snake or what they want.

249
00:15:18,600 --> 00:15:20,600
Wait, you're seriously helping it?

250
00:15:20,960 --> 00:15:23,197
It murdered five people
without a second thought!

251
00:15:23,280 --> 00:15:27,040
And in case you forgot, it
literally isn't even human! Exactly.

252
00:15:27,260 --> 00:15:28,597
Think about what you just said.

253
00:15:28,680 --> 00:15:31,377
If it's not human, it
probably isn't guilty either.

254
00:15:31,460 --> 00:15:33,857
The one who's at fault here is Pale Snake.

255
00:15:33,940 --> 00:15:36,057
That bastard only passed
along enough information

256
