265
00:16:02,420 --> 00:16:05,597
All I want is to get back the
Disks that were my father's.

266
00:16:05,680 --> 00:16:09,300
Also, I want to know every
detail about Palesnake's agenda.

267
00:16:09,620 --> 00:16:10,760
So how about it?

268
00:16:10,920 --> 00:16:12,155
Will you help us out?

269
00:16:12,420 --> 00:16:15,479
It's your choice, but there
will be no more killing.

270
00:16:16,800 --> 00:16:17,860
Fuck me.

271
00:16:18,060 --> 00:16:19,295
This is unbelievable.

272
00:16:19,980 --> 00:16:21,640
Your strange sentiments.

273
00:16:22,020 --> 00:16:26,397
I don't quite understand them very well,
but I don't feel like biting anymore.

274
00:16:26,480 --> 00:16:30,080
And now, I've been defeated completely.

275
00:16:48,960 --> 00:16:51,220
They really are here! We did it!

276
00:16:57,940 --> 00:17:01,587
Alright, I finally found the
disc that contains Star Platinum!

277
00:17:03,660 --> 00:17:04,490
Jolene!

278
