Hey, are you okay?

279
00:17:08,040 --> 00:17:12,417
Yeah, it rejected me, but it's
definitely Star Platinum's disc.

280
00:17:12,500 --> 00:17:16,540
Now that I have this, I can
revive my father, Jotaro Kujo!

281
00:17:17,220 --> 00:17:18,460
