Hey, if I were to jump off from that
window up there, you think I'd die?

287
00:17:35,680 --> 00:17:37,537
Hey, no need to get hostile, guys.

288
00:17:37,620 --> 00:17:38,760
It's me! It's me!

289
00:17:40,020 --> 00:17:41,457
