301
00:18:16,340 --> 00:18:20,440
She's Atro, and her
prisoner number is FV39423.

302
00:18:20,900 --> 00:18:24,917
Back when she was just a little kid,
she always dreamed of being kidnapped.

303
00:18:25,000 --> 00:18:29,220
So, when she grew up, she kidnapped
a child the way she wanted to be.

304
00:18:29,580 --> 00:18:32,177
She didn't even do it for
ransom money or anything.

305
00:18:32,260 --> 00:18:33,720
She sort of just did it.

306
00:18:34,140 --> 00:18:37,316
Oh, hey, it looks like both
of your arms are bleeding.

307
00:18:40,140 --> 00:18:41,120
So does it hurt?

308
00:18:41,380 --> 00:18:43,968
I really wish I could
heal you, but I can't.

309
00:18:47,680 --> 00:18:48,717
Get your tongue off of me, you grip!

310
00:18:48,800 --> 00:18:49,630
