313
00:18:52,860 --> 00:18:53,919
I hate you, water!

314
00:18:55,400 --> 00:18:57,220
Yeah, you sure ain't human.

315
00:18:57,560 --> 00:19:01,077
Before you go to prison, there
are some things you gotta learn.

316
00:19:01,160 --> 00:19:04,437
I'd say drinking with a cup would
be a pretty good place to start.

317
00:19:04,520 --> 00:19:05,350
A cup?

318
00:19:05,540 --> 00:19:06,917
