coming out to this storehouse?

323
00:19:19,560 --> 00:19:20,390
Nope.

324
00:19:20,473 --> 00:19:24,497
They rarely have ever come near the tractor,
and I've never seen the user either.

325
00:19:24,580 --> 00:19:28,017
The pile of discs here are the
ones that Palesnake doesn't need.

326
00:19:28,100 --> 00:19:31,337
You probably know this already, but
no matter how strong a stand is,

327
00:19:31,420 --> 00:19:34,057
