memories must be stored somewhere else.

331
00:19:42,420 --> 00:19:46,217
That's why you won't be able to find
the memory disc you're looking for.

332
00:19:46,300 --> 00:19:50,837
The thing pale snake wanted to
steal from your father wasn't his

333
