body will begin to deteriorate.

345
00:20:25,800 --> 00:20:26,630
Eventually,

346
00:20:26,713 --> 00:20:28,757
I'll take back His memory
disc no matter what

347
00:20:28,840 --> 00:20:31,917
it takes you want to get
it out of prison huh?

348
00:20:32,000 --> 00:20:34,337
That's gonna be a lot harder
than if you were bringing

349
00:20:34,420 --> 00:20:37,217
something in and when the guards
get here they're definitely

350
00:20:37,300 --> 00:20:38,557
gonna inspect us from head

351
00:20:38,640 --> 00:20:44,517
to toe get the disc to me all

