362
00:21:37,940 --> 00:21:39,040
Jolene Kujo.

363
00:21:39,340 --> 00:21:44,037
Is it possible she defeated that incompetent
guard and took the disc all by herself?

364
00:21:44,120 --> 00:21:47,357
Or perhaps these other two
