378
00:22:59,680 --> 00:23:03,360
About my destiny?

379
00:23:05,960 --> 00:23:09,037
I'm thinking about.

380
00:23:09,120 --> 00:23:13,557
Out all the

381
00:23:13,640 --> 00:23:18,077
things I'd

382
00:23:18,160 --> 00:23:25,060
